":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-16T13:54:57Z","updated_at":"2025-05-16T13:54:57Z","body":"Reopening as #104357 is being reverted due to regressions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2886797550/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3505113534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100536#issuecomment-3505113534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100536","id":3505113534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q68m-","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T21:49:04Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T21:50:17Z","body":"This issue also happens when clicking the reset symbol on the container size. After that, it will gladly extend beyond it, but will never shrink smaller than the size when the reset symbol was clicked.\n* To try, just add an HBox/VBox Container, add some children, hit reset size, delete any of them\n\nLooking at #104357 , the solution was applied to `Control::set_position`, but `Control::set_size` (which gets called when reset size is clicked) has the same \"failing\" code. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3505113534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275733697","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100536#issuecomment-4275733697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100536","id":4275733697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-2oTB","user":{"login":"james-hill-cfix","id":90580573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTgwNTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90580573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix","html_url":"https://github.com/james-hill-cfix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/james-hill-cfix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-19T10:45:07Z","updated_at":"2026-04-19T10:46:17Z","body":"Noting a workaround here for anyone else ratting around in the issues:\n\nI managed to work around this issue for my specific case by connecting `FoldableContainer.folding_changed` to a handler that invoked `reset_size()` on my `GraphNode`. This successfully resized the `GraphNode` after the `FoldableContainer` collapsed, making it nice and small again.\n\nFound the solution (or something similar at https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100626#issuecomment-4054381398)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4275733697/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]